Please send the following response to the employee. We will have to extend the deadline, so we will keep this ticket open until we have fully fulfilled the request. We will come back to you once we have the final response and the data.

Response:

{color:#0747a6}*_Data Subject Rights Request – Extension of Time_*{color}

{color:#0747a6}_Thank you for your recent data subject rights request, which we received on October 14th, 2024._{color}

{color:#0747a6}_We are writing to inform you that we require additional time to fulfil your request as we have deemed it to be complex. Under relevant data protection legislation, we are permitted to extend the deadline for response by up to an additional two months, which we have determined to be necessary in this instance._{color}

{color:#0747a6}_Due to the nature of your request, additional time is needed to gather all the requested information and prepare it for you in a clear and understandable format. Furthermore, your request for restriction of processing requires additional consideration and implementation to ensure compliance with the GDPR's requirements._{color}

{color:#0747a6}_We apologise for any inconvenience caused by this extension.  We are committed to providing you with a response to your request as soon as possible. We anticipate that we will be able to respond to your request no later than January 14th, 2025 which is three months from the date we received your request._{color}

{color:#0747a6}_If you have any questions about your request, please do not hesitate to contact Bolt Privacy Team at_ {color}[{color:#0747a6}_privacy@bolt.eu_{color}|mailto:privacy@bolt.eu]{color:#0747a6}_._{color}

{color:#0747a6}_Thank you for your patience._{color}

{color:#0747a6}_Yours sincerely,_{color}

{color:#0747a6}_Bolt Privacy Team_{color}



----

Please let me know here once you have sent the response. Thank you!

Eliise

